  "changes": [
    "Exactly original first 7 text/shape/code slides and final ending retained. Two complete remote media slides and their stack wrapper excluded, not replaced. Explicitly an eight-slide media-free excerpt, not full original demo.",
    "Use actual fixed Reveal source modules and Highlight plugin. Only JavaScript and XML grammar registered from actual highlight.js11.11.1 for the original React/JSX code example; original code is highlighted text, not executed as React.",
    "No Markdown or speaker-notes plugin: retained slides contain no Markdown-source slides or speaker notes. No notes window, hash/history writes, postMessage API/events or preview-link overlay.",
    "Scroll position sessionStorage bindings replaced by private memory Map for this iframe. Original scroll trigger, fragments, autoanimate and code-line-number mechanisms unchanged.",
    "Strip original embedded WOFF font-face rules; retain original theme font fallback. Strip three unused external-preview overlay base64 image declarations (2 SVG icons + spinner GIF); that overlay is disabled and absent from this excerpt. No binary is re-encoded/packaged.",
    "Add Chinese scope/8-chapter selector using original deck.slide(h,0), owned teardown, hidden pause and reduced-motion configuration. Original shape geometry and code content preserved."
  ],
  "excludedMedia": [
    {
      "slide": "Image Backgrounds",
      "url": "https://static.slid.es/reveal/image-placeholder.png"
    },
    {
      "slide": "Video background",
      "urls": [
        "https://s3.amazonaws.com/static.slid.es/site/homepage/v1/homepage-video-editor.mp4",
        "https://s3.amazonaws.com/static.slid.es/site/homepage/v1/homepage-video-editor.webm"
      ]
    }
